4- devTools.send(Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride(600,1000,50,true, optional....);    
     // "Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride()" is an already developed/devised method in the "Emulation" class. 
	

5- driver.get("www.amazon.com");  // The output: is that of a mobile view.
